  message: "2026-11-07 docstring audit (dev 4f2feb451b): still holds. The python DDG spec has function_node_types={function_definition} and no bound_callable_node_types (ddg_build.py:1117-1126); f = lambda: os.environ['K'] gets no return_spans entry. The ddg_build module docstring's lambda example is being corrected to say so. r19, v07."  # e656
